// expect: 91
// SYNTAX §«Token enumeration» — TIntLit's four spellings, each read by the
// ONE scanner that proves it. 0b1011 = 11, 0o17 = 15, 0x2A = 42, 23 = 23,
// and the underscore separators are visual only: 11 + 15 + 42 + 23 = 91.
//
// The control for the malformed twins in tests/micros. Before the scanner
// returned its own value, a second walk re-derived these from the source
// slice with a different digit classifier, and where the two disagreed the
// second one answered 0.
fn main() = 0b1_011 + 0o17 + 0x2A + 2_3
